;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>At that moment, my life. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, the lives of many people, and their fates, were split in two.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\No_Escapeこもり.ogg" "BGM2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\No_Escape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\ゲーム1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I've finally made it this far. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I need to get fired up, but I just can't seem to focus. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In this state, there's no way I can break through this situation.<PG>
But maybe that's fine too. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Going down before this giant enemy is life too. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no need to put that much into a made-up life.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "0" "10000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "BGM2" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\ゲーム2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Haah..." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I haven't even cleared it yet, and I'm already getting a little bored of this game. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I work my part-time job, go to drinking parties, and when I have time, I shut myself in my room and play games alone. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These days most games are on smartphones or downloads, but I mostly <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="たしな">play</STYLE> physical copies.<PG>
There were no game consoles in the Arata settlement, so I just used to long for them a little, that's all. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I love most is that stretch of time when I put the software into the hardware and wait, gripping the controller, for the game to start up. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All at once I slip into the world of the game and turn my eyes away from reality for a while. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The entertainment I couldn't enjoy in the Arata settlement is one of my pleasures, and a way to keep my mind healthy, too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM2" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Back then, I―
{PAUSE ""}
tried to kill <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間割れる暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I still remember it clearly. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Out of nowhere, an unbearable murderous intent toward <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> welled up in me, and I tried to stab her to death. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was restrained and locked up in the underground storeroom.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
For several days I kept passing out and coming to, and <STYLE ID="4">Grandma</STYLE> stayed by my side the whole time, watching over me. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's all I remember. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="4">Grandma</STYLE> hadn't kept encouraging me, I would no doubt have died in a frenzy. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's how terrible my murderous intent toward <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> was.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
But a few days later, my frenzy subsided, just like that. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the moment it did, I was laid up for several more days, this time from exhaustion. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The day I woke up was, if I remember right―
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "254" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\夢見る憧憬.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\夏菜の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Shiyo 790, April 12―10 years ago. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was after <STYLE ID="5">Uncle Eiichiro's</STYLE> third-year memorial service had ended. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently <STYLE ID="6">Auntie</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE> had both come to the memorial service while I was asleep. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I'd thought I would get to see <STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE> for the first time in ages. What a shame...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"How about it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">? Feeling all right now?" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I'm all better now!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Is that so, is that so. Then that's fine."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Grandma</STYLE> gently stroked my head. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And with it, the memory of my violent murderous intent toward <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As that hideous feeling came back to me, my face went stiff, and <STYLE ID="4">Grandma</STYLE> didn't miss it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"It's all right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. There's nothing to worry about." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Grandma</STYLE> hugged me tight. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, I was terrified. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was terrified of myself, for having tried to kill <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> when I loved her so much.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Where's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"She's in the kitchen right now. Want to see </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">?" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Would <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> be angry with me? Did she hate me now? 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to see her, but I couldn't say so right away.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ指さしバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"All right, let's go see her together." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">Grandma</STYLE> picked me up and carried me out of the room. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was almost 11, but <STYLE ID="4">Grandma</STYLE> lifted me like it was nothing and carried me down the stairs. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I clung to <STYLE ID="4">Grandma</STYLE> the whole way. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tightly, so tightly, I clung on.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Are you all right now?" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seeing me, <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> let out a happy cry. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I kept my eyes shut, clung to <STYLE ID="4">Grandma</STYLE>, and turned my face away. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How was I supposed to look <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> in the face?<PG>
Then, a hand gently stroking my hair. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>, stroking it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Go on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, go to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>, just like <STYLE ID="4">Grandma</STYLE>, took me up in her arms, though I'd grown much too big to be held.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"There, there, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. You were scared, weren't you? It's all right now." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At those words, a <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="どうこく">wail</STYLE> far too terrible to call crying tore my throat apart.<PG>
I wanted to tell <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> I was sorry. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to tell <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> I loved her so much. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But my <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="おえつ">sobs</STYLE> got in the way. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Instead, I held on to <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> tight.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> hugged me back, as if she understood what was in my heart. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thank goodness. <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> didn't hate me. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We could all go on living happily together again, the same as always. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those nightmarish few days really were a nightmare―a dream. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I would tuck the bad dream away in the shadow of a happy reality.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
But it wasn't long before that reality was swallowed up by a bad dream again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\春花子供ショート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "10000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
Shiyo 790, April 17―five days after I woke up. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Auntie</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE> had come to the Arata settlement again. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They'd come for <STYLE ID="5">Uncle's</STYLE> third-year memorial service too, but I hadn't gotten to see them.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Ahaha! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! Are you all better now!?" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I'm all better now!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE> was as bright and lively as ever. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, she was even livelier than when I'd seen her at New Year's. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And there was a big change in how she looked, too. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\春花子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Haruka's</STYLE> hair, once long and beautiful, had become short.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\春花子供ショート.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, that hairstyle looks really good on you!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Ehehe, thanks!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE> seemed pretty pleased to have her hairstyle complimented. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tried stroking <STYLE ID="7">Haruka's</STYLE> short hair.<PG>
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "0" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Ah, ow!" </STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment I touched her head, <STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE> flinched and knocked my hand away. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Sorry." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On reflex, I apologized too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... did you hurt your head?" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Oh, yeah... a little..." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE> looked away, a little awkward. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Child though I was, I wondered if that had been a question I shouldn't ask.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Oh, I'll go check on </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
And with that, <STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE> went into the house as if running away from me. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had I done something I shouldn't have after all...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―<STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE> was crawling on all fours after <STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE>, who was crawling around exploring the house. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE> must have met <STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE> at the memorial service too, since she seemed attached to her and wasn't shy at all.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I was sitting on a branch of the cherry tree, looking out over the settlement. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From up here, I could see the whole settlement. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The last few cherry blossoms were scattering across the whole settlement.<PG>
